msgid "Still connecting to WhatsApp Web"
msgstr "Masih menyambung ke WhatsApp Web"

msgid ""
"Connecting to WhatsApp Web in {browser}. If {browser} asks whether to allow remote debugging, choose "
"Allow: press Shift+Tab, then Enter."
msgstr ""
"Menyambung ke WhatsApp Web di {browser}. Kalau {browser} bertanya apakah mengizinkan remote debugging, "
"pilih Allow: tekan Shift+Tab, lalu Enter."

msgid "Record voice notes in &stereo when the microphone has two channels (iPhones cannot play them)"
msgstr "Rekam voice note dalam &stereo bila mikrofon punya dua kanal (tidak bisa diputar di iPhone)"

msgid "Use the microphone's own sound: no echo cancellation, noise suppression or automatic volume"
msgstr "Pakai suara asli mikrofon: tanpa peredam gema, peredam bising, atau volume otomatis"

msgid "Connect with NVDA+Shift+W to choose from all your microphones."
msgstr "Sambungkan dengan NVDA+Shift+W untuk memilih dari semua mikrofon Anda."

msgid "Something went wrong. Details are in NVDA's log."
msgstr "Terjadi kesalahan. Rinciannya ada di log NVDA."

msgid ""
"Remote debugging is not turned on in your browser. In Brave, open a new tab, go to "
"brave://inspect/#remote-debugging and check Allow remote debugging for this browser instance. Then press "
"NVDA+Shift+W again."
msgstr ""
"Remote debugging belum dinyalakan di browser Anda. Di Brave, buka tab baru, buka "
"brave://inspect/#remote-debugging lalu centang Allow remote debugging for this browser instance. Setelah "
"itu tekan NVDA+Shift+W lagi."

msgid "WhatsApp Web is still loading. Try again in a moment."
msgstr "WhatsApp Web masih memuat. Coba lagi sebentar lagi."

msgid "The connection to WhatsApp Web was lost. Press NVDA+Shift+W to connect again."
msgstr "Sambungan ke WhatsApp Web terputus. Tekan NVDA+Shift+W untuk menyambung lagi."

msgid "This chat is no longer in WhatsApp."
msgstr "Chat ini sudah tidak ada di WhatsApp."

msgid "Nothing was recorded."
msgstr "Tidak ada yang terekam."

msgid "This voice message cannot be downloaded any more. Listen to it in WhatsApp on your phone."
msgstr "Pesan suara ini sudah tidak bisa diunduh. Dengarkan di WhatsApp di ponsel Anda."

msgid "{browser} did not allow the connection. Press NVDA+Shift+W to try again, and choose Allow."
msgstr "{browser} tidak mengizinkan sambungan. Tekan NVDA+Shift+W untuk mencoba lagi, lalu pilih Allow."

msgid "{browser}'s question was not answered. Press NVDA+Shift+W to try again."
msgstr "Pertanyaan {browser} tidak dijawab. Tekan NVDA+Shift+W untuk mencoba lagi."

msgid "WhatsApp Web is not open in {browser}. Open web.whatsapp.com, log in, then try again."
msgstr "WhatsApp Web belum terbuka di {browser}. Buka web.whatsapp.com, masuk, lalu coba lagi."

msgid ""
"The microphone could not be used ({reason}). Check that WhatsApp Web may use the microphone in {browser}, "
"and that no other program is holding it."
msgstr ""
"Mikrofon tidak bisa dipakai ({reason}). Pastikan WhatsApp Web boleh memakai mikrofon di {browser}, dan "
"tidak ada program lain yang sedang memakainya."

msgid "WhatsApp did not send it ({reason})."
msgstr "WhatsApp tidak mengirimnya ({reason})."

