msgid "&Hidden browser. Needs Brave, Google Chrome or another Chromium browser, version 120 or newer. None was found on this computer."
msgstr "Browser &tersembunyi. Butuh Brave, Google Chrome, atau browser Chromium lain, versi 120 atau lebih baru. Tidak ada yang ditemukan di komputer ini."

msgid "&Hidden {browser} (recommended). WhatsApp runs in its own hidden browser, with no window. You link it once with a code on your phone. It uses about 400 to 600 MB of memory."
msgstr "{browser} &tersembunyi (disarankan). WhatsApp berjalan di browser tersembunyinya sendiri, tanpa jendela. Anda menautkannya sekali dengan kode di ponsel. Memakai sekitar 400 sampai 600 MB memori."

