#. sent are taken off the list, so Enter sends only the rest.
msgid "{sent} of {count} sent; Enter sends the rest"
msgstr "{sent} dari {count} terkirim; Enter mengirim sisanya"

#. Translators: Said after connecting when a WhatsApp update stopped some of the add-on's features from working.
msgid "WhatsApp has changed, so these are off until the add-on is updated: {features}"
msgstr "WhatsApp sudah berubah, jadi fitur ini mati sampai add-on diperbarui: {features}"

#. Translators: A feature that is off because WhatsApp changed: hearing about edited messages.
msgid "edited messages"
msgstr "pesan yang diedit"

#. Translators: A feature that is off because WhatsApp changed: sent, delivered and read ticks.
msgid "delivered and read"
msgstr "terkirim dan dibaca"

#. Translators: A feature that is off because WhatsApp changed: reactions to messages.
msgid "reactions"
msgstr "reaksi"

#. Translators: A feature that is off because WhatsApp changed: choosing the microphone.
msgid "the chosen microphone"
msgstr "mikrofon pilihan"

#. Translators: A feature that is off because WhatsApp changed: hearing about calls.
msgid "calls"
msgstr "panggilan"

#. Translators: A feature that is off because WhatsApp changed: hearing when the connection drops.
msgid "connection lost and back"
msgstr "koneksi putus dan tersambung lagi"

#. Translators: A feature that is off because WhatsApp changed: the chat list updating by itself.
msgid "the chat list updating by itself"
msgstr "daftar chat yang diperbarui sendiri"

#. Translators: Reported when a file in a message is too large for the add-on to download.
msgid "This file is larger than {size} MB. Open it in WhatsApp on your phone."
msgstr "File ini lebih dari {size} MB. Buka di WhatsApp di ponselmu."

#. Translators: Said when the add-on could not find out who is speaking in a call.
msgid "Could not find out who is speaking ({reason})"
msgstr "Tidak bisa mengetahui siapa yang sedang bicara ({reason})"

#. Translators: Said when raising or lowering the user's hand in a group call failed.
msgid "The hand could not be raised or lowered ({reason})"
msgstr "Tangan tidak bisa diangkat atau diturunkan ({reason})"

#. Translators: Said when the microphone could not be turned off or on during a call.
msgid "The microphone could not be changed ({reason})"
msgstr "Mikrofon tidak bisa diubah ({reason})"

#. Translators: Reported after the user liked a status. WhatsApp Web cannot react to a status,
#. so the heart goes to the poster's chat as a reply to the status. {name} is the poster.
msgid "Liked: a heart was sent to {name} as a reply to the status"
msgstr "Disukai: hati dikirim ke {name} sebagai balasan status"

#. Translators: Said when the user likes a status they already liked.
msgid "Already liked"
msgstr "Sudah disukai"

#. Translators: Reported after saving the profile when the user emptied the About text.
msgid "Profile saved. About was not emptied: WhatsApp needs some text there."
msgstr "Profil disimpan. Info tidak dikosongkan: WhatsApp memerlukan teks di sana."

#. Translators: Said when WhatsApp is asked to start after an update was installed but before NVDA restarted.
msgid "WhatsApp Access was updated. Restart NVDA to open WhatsApp again"
msgstr "WhatsApp Access sudah diperbarui. Mulai ulang NVDA untuk membuka WhatsApp lagi"

#. Translators: Reported when unlinking could not remove all of WhatsApp's data.
msgid "Some of WhatsApp's data on this computer could not be removed. Restart NVDA, then unlink again."
msgstr "Sebagian data WhatsApp di komputer ini tidak bisa dihapus. Mulai ulang NVDA, lalu putuskan tautan lagi."

#. Translators: Reported when the data was removed but WhatsApp could not be told of the unlinking.
msgid "WhatsApp's data was removed from this computer, but WhatsApp could not be told. Remove this computer under Linked devices on your phone."
msgstr "Data WhatsApp sudah dihapus dari komputer ini, tetapi WhatsApp tidak bisa diberi tahu. Hapus komputer ini di Perangkat tertaut di HP Anda."

#. Translators: Said when a voice note stops by itself because it reached the longest length.
msgid "Recording stopped after 30 minutes"
msgstr "Rekaman berhenti setelah 30 menit"

#. Translators: Reported when a file could not get the mark Windows gives files from the internet, so it
#. is not opened; the user can still save it.
msgid "The file could not be opened safely here. Save it with Alt+D instead."
msgstr "File ini tidak bisa dibuka dengan aman di sini. Simpan dengan Alt+D saja."

msgid "The update needed to use WhatsApp is on its way"
msgstr "Update yang diperlukan untuk memakai WhatsApp sedang disiapkan"

msgid "WhatsApp Web changed, and WhatsApp Access {current} no longer works with it. Install version {new} to use WhatsApp again; until then WhatsApp stays closed."
msgstr "WhatsApp Web berubah, dan WhatsApp Access {current} tidak bisa dipakai lagi dengannya. Pasang versi {new} untuk memakai WhatsApp lagi; sampai saat itu WhatsApp tetap tertutup."

msgid "&Later"
msgstr "&Nanti"

msgid "WhatsApp Access must be updated before WhatsApp can be used again"
msgstr "WhatsApp Access harus diperbarui dulu sebelum WhatsApp bisa dipakai lagi"

msgid "&Document…"
msgstr "&Dokumen…"

msgid "&Photos and videos…"
msgstr "&Foto dan video…"

msgid "&Audio…"
msgstr "A&udio…"

msgid "P&oll…"
msgstr "P&olling…"

msgid "Audio"
msgstr "Audio"

msgid "A poll can have at most {count} options"
msgstr "Polling paling banyak punya {count} pilihan"

msgid "The question can be at most {count} characters"
msgstr "Pertanyaannya paling panjang {count} karakter"

msgid "Each option can be at most {count} characters: {option}"
msgstr "Setiap pilihan paling panjang {count} karakter: {option}"

msgid "Two options are the same: {option}"
msgstr "Ada dua pilihan yang sama: {option}"
#. Translators: The label of the box in the call window that says who is calling and how it goes.
msgid "Call:"
msgstr "Panggilan:"

msgid "&Options"
msgstr "&Opsi"

msgid "Open a WhatsApp &link…"
msgstr "Buka &link WhatsApp…"

msgid "Mark all as &read"
msgstr "Tandai semua sudah &dibaca"

msgid "WhatsApp link, such as a group's invite link, a channel or a wa.me link:"
msgstr "Link WhatsApp, misalnya link undangan grup, channel, atau link wa.me:"

msgid "Open a WhatsApp link"
msgstr "Buka link WhatsApp"

msgid "Opening link"
msgstr "Membuka link"

msgid "Call links cannot be joined from WhatsApp Access yet. Open it on your phone."
msgstr "Link panggilan belum bisa dibuka dari WhatsApp Access. Buka di HP Anda."

msgid "WhatsApp Access cannot open this kind of link."
msgstr "WhatsApp Access tidak bisa membuka link jenis ini."

msgid "You already asked to join {name}. Its admins have not answered yet."
msgstr "Anda sudah meminta bergabung ke {name}. Admin grupnya belum menjawab."

msgid "In the community {name}"
msgstr "Di komunitas {name}"

msgid "{count} members"
msgstr "{count} anggota"

msgid "Ask to join {name}? Its admins approve new members."
msgstr "Minta bergabung ke {name}? Anggota baru disetujui oleh admin grupnya."

msgid "Join group"
msgstr "Bergabung ke grup"

msgid "Request sent. You join when an admin approves it."
msgstr "Permintaan terkirim. Anda bergabung setelah admin menyetujuinya."

msgid "{count} followers"
msgstr "{count} pengikut"

msgid "Follow the channel {name}?"
msgstr "Ikuti channel {name}?"

msgid "Channel"
msgstr "Channel"

msgid "&Follow"
msgstr "&Ikuti"

msgid "&Open without following"
msgstr "&Buka tanpa mengikuti"

msgid "Mark all chats as read? People who turned on read receipts see that you read their messages."
msgstr "Tandai semua chat sudah dibaca? Orang yang menyalakan laporan dibaca akan melihat bahwa Anda sudah membaca pesannya."

msgid "Mark all as read"
msgstr "Tandai semua sudah dibaca"

msgid "{count} chats marked as read"
msgstr "{count} chat ditandai sudah dibaca"

msgid "marked unread"
msgstr "ditandai belum dibaca"

msgid "This group link no longer works. Ask for a new one."
msgstr "Link grup ini sudah tidak berlaku. Minta link yang baru."

msgid "Could not join the group. Try again, or join from WhatsApp on your phone."
msgstr "Tidak bisa bergabung ke grup. Coba lagi, atau bergabung dari WhatsApp di HP Anda."

msgid "This channel could not be found."
msgstr "Channel ini tidak ditemukan."

msgid "&Replies	Alt+R"
msgstr "&Balasan	Alt+R"

msgid "&Your reply:"
msgstr "Balasan &Anda:"

msgid "Replies"
msgstr "Balasan"

msgid "Reply sent"
msgstr "Balasan terkirim"

msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "Memuat…"

msgid "&Replies:"
msgstr "&Balasan:"

msgid "{count} replies"
msgstr "{count} balasan"

msgid "No replies yet"
msgstr "Belum ada balasan"

msgid "1 reply"
msgstr "1 balasan"

msgid "You can't send messages to this group because you're no longer a member."
msgstr "Anda tidak bisa mengirim pesan ke grup ini karena Anda bukan anggota lagi."

msgid "Only the channel's admins can post. Alt+Y reacts to a post."
msgstr "Hanya admin channel yang bisa memposting. Alt+Y memberi reaksi pada postingan."

msgid "Only community admins can send announcements. Alt+R lists an announcement's replies and replies to it."
msgstr "Hanya admin komunitas yang bisa mengirim pengumuman. Alt+R menampilkan balasan sebuah pengumuman dan membalasnya."

msgid "Only admins can send messages. Alt+R replies privately to the sender of a message."
msgstr "Hanya admin yang bisa mengirim pesan. Alt+R membalas pengirim sebuah pesan secara pribadi."

msgid "Describe this image in detail for a blind person: what is in it, where things are, colours, and any text in it, word for word."
msgstr "Deskripsikan gambar ini secara detail untuk orang tunanetra: apa saja isinya, letak benda-benda, warna, dan semua teks di dalamnya, kata demi kata."

msgid "Asking Meta AI to describe the photo…"
msgstr "Meminta Meta AI mendeskripsikan foto…"

msgid "Photos are described by Meta AI. Start a chat with Meta AI in WhatsApp on your phone first."
msgstr "Foto dideskripsikan oleh Meta AI. Mulai dulu chat dengan Meta AI di WhatsApp di HP Anda."

msgid "Meta AI did not answer in time. Its answer may still come in the chat with Meta AI."
msgstr "Meta AI tidak menjawab tepat waktu. Jawabannya mungkin masih akan muncul di chat dengan Meta AI."

msgid "Describe this image for a blind person. Start with one sentence saying what it is. Then give the important details in a few short sentences. Read out any text in it word for word. Leave out colours, background and lighting unless they matter."
msgstr "Deskripsikan gambar ini untuk orang tunanetra. Mulai dengan satu kalimat tentang gambar apa ini. Lalu sebutkan detail yang penting dalam beberapa kalimat pendek. Bacakan semua teks di dalamnya kata demi kata. Tidak perlu menyebut warna, latar belakang, dan pencahayaan kecuali penting."

msgid "&Question Meta AI is asked to describe a photo (Alt+P):"
msgstr "&Pertanyaan untuk Meta AI saat mendeskripsikan foto (Alt+P):"

msgid "WhatsApp Web did not open in {browser}. The page said: {detail} Check the internet connection, and whether a firewall or antivirus blocks {browser}."
msgstr "WhatsApp Web tidak terbuka di {browser}. Halamannya menyebutkan: {detail} Periksa koneksi internet, dan apakah firewall atau antivirus memblokir {browser}."

msgid "Voice message position, seconds:"
msgstr "Posisi pesan suara, detik:"

msgid "Voice message position:"
msgstr "Posisi pesan suara:"

msgid "{position} of {length}"
msgstr "{position} dari {length}"

msgid "Pinned: {message}"
msgstr "Disematkan: {message}"

